      "value": "@{5e89d0822aedbc56a3155d12|full_name} Is this exclusive to video players or are voices affected too?\n\nVideo players losing audio is not exclusive to wireless; it happens on a Valve Index too if the audio device becomes disconnected (due to a bad tether cable or other reasons), for example TTS Voice Wizard reports a lost audio recording device. Voices from users keep working.",
